  "learnings": [
    "Ktor 3.2.0 does not publish a gRPC server artifact in Maven Central; the generated backend uses grpc-kotlin/Netty for the gRPC transport and keeps Ktor as the selected framework dependency surface.",
    "Specmatic Enterprise 1.19.1 accepts v3 protobuf run options but does not apply protobuf import-path fields from specmatic.yaml; the test script stages imported proto support files in .specmatic_grpc_working_dir, which the runtime already includes in its descriptor-generation proto path."
